{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2022-04-08 11:00:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ANNOUNCES SCHEDULE FOR FIRST QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "DALLAS , APRIL 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) WILL ISSUE ITS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS ON FRIDAY, APRIL 22 WITH A NEWS RELEASE ISSUED VIA PR NEWSWIRE AND FIRST CALL AT APPROXIMATELY 6:30 A.M. CDT. IN ADDITION TO THE NEWS RELEASE, THE COMPANY WILL MAKE AVAILABLE PREPARED MANAGEMENT REMARKS FROM KIMBERLY-CLARK'S CHAIRMAN AND CEO MIKE HSU AND CFO MARIA HENRY AT APPROXIMATELY 7 A.M."}